        "id": 1550939
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-24T09:15:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ConfiguredJarList looks good to me. The interface will be used for lists of bootclasspath/system server jars, so having \"JarList\" in the name is a good idea. \"Configured\" is a bit long but ok.",
      "parentUuid": "03c268fb_72bdd90d",
      "range": {
